## Project purpose

Production portal for land, plots, and property listings across Zanzibar — the main Real Estate division web product.

- **Target audience:** Investors, diaspora buyers, developers, local purchasers
- **Key locations:** Paje, Nungwi, Kendwa, Stone Town, and island-wide
- **Geography:** Zanzibar-first; Tanzania mainland where relevant
- **Integrations:** Cloudinary (media), Outscraper (data enrichment)
- **Status:** Production — `npm run build` verified (May 2026)

## Design style

Investor-grade luxury corporate real estate (EMAAR/DAMAC reference per group guidelines):

- Clean listing cards with trust signals (verified listings, contact CTAs)
- Restrained palette — no neon, loud gradients, or off-brand accents
- Coastal and architectural photography; avoid generic stock
- Reference layouts: `assets/mockups/` when present

## Coding standards

| Layer | Choice |
|-------|--------|
| Framework | Next.js 14 App Router |
| UI | React 18, TypeScript |
| Styling | Tailwind CSS 3.4, PostCSS |
| Images | Cloudinary + Next.js `<Image>` |
| Alias | `@/` → project root |

**Structure:** `app/` (routes + layouts) · `components/` (Header, Footer, listing UI) · `public/` (static)

**Commands:** `npm run dev` · `npm run build` · `npm run lint`

Prefer functional components, typed props, and colocated page metadata exports.

## Preferred UI direction

- **Mobile-first** — sticky Header/Footer shell in `app/layout.tsx`
- Extend existing Tailwind tokens (`brand`, `sand`) — do not invent parallel color systems
- SEO: metadata in root layout + per-page `generateMetadata` where needed
- Listing pages: fast LCP — optimize hero and card images
- Contact flows: WhatsApp/phone patterns consistent with group sites

## Common tasks

- New listing page → `app/` route + reusable card component
- Brand update → sync from `shared-assets/` or corporate-hq `brand/logos-v2/`
- Image upload → Cloudinary config in existing integration

